description:
Apply a patch that adds, updates, moves or deletes files. Format: *** Begin Patch, then per file *** Add File: path (lines prefixed with +), *** Update File: path (optional *** Move to: path, then @@ hunks with space, - and + lines and unique exact context), or *** Delete File: path, then *** End Patch. Example: {"patch":"*** Begin Patch
*** Update File: src/app.ts
@@
-const a = 1;
+const a = 2;
*** End Patch"}. All files are checked before any change; a failure while writing stops the remaining files and is reported per file. Limits: 1 MiB patch, 64 paths, 16 MiB per file. The result lists one line per changed file with its line counts. Successful changes appear in the Files changed panel.
